  "seoBody": "<h2>Why per-seat pricing is hard on small firms</h2><p>Many tools charge for every name on the account. A name that does no checks still costs you money.</p><h2>How Quickler is priced</h2><p>£75 a month for each phone number that did at least one check that month. Everyone else is free. The minimum is £75 a month.</p><p>[[price:bundles]]</p><p>Paid accounts have no limits: reports, photos and messages are unlimited.</p><p>The free plan gives you 10 Records a month, up to 10 photos each, and no card. You are billed monthly by UK Direct Debit.</p><h2>What that looks like</h2><p><strong>Twenty people, six did checks this month.</strong> You pay for six phone numbers. The other fourteen cost nothing.</p><p><strong>A quiet winter.</strong> You pay the £75 minimum. You pay more only in months when more people do checks.</p><h2>When Quickler is not the right pick</h2><p>Quickler is not job management. It does not schedule, invoice or dispatch. It writes your reports from your walk. You still sign them.</p><p><a href=\"/pages/alternatives.html\">Where Quickler fits and where it does not</a>.</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>What if I add more people?</h3><p>Adding people is free. You pay only for phone numbers that did at least one check that month. Everyone else costs nothing.</p><h3>Is there a free trial?</h3><p>There is no timed trial. There is a free plan: 10 Records a month, up to 10 photos each, no card. Move to paid when you need more.</p><h3>What if we only need it for a few months a year?</h3><p>You pay for the phone numbers that did a check, in the months they did one. The minimum is £75 a month. Billing is monthly by UK Direct Debit.</p><h3>Do you charge per seat?</h3><p>No. You pay per phone number that did a check. People who did no check cost nothing.</p>",
